        231.46373989898996,
        941.3953876225492,
        17.434861742424232
      ],
      "text": "abandoned, and the water shall thereupon be available for disposition as unappropriated waters in accordance",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        258.24081660353545,
        273.91458370098036,
        17.434861742424232
      ],
      "text": "with the provisions of this Code.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        303.6132051767677,
        941.414397017974,
        17.434861742424232
      ],
      "text": "ARTICLE 96. No vested or acquired right to the use of water can arise from acts or omissions which are",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        330.39035953282826,
        496.71037577614385,
        17.434861742424232
      ],
      "text": "against the law or which infringe upon the rights of others.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        375.7625928030303,
        941.425852900327,
        17.434900568181774
      ],
      "text": "ARTICLE 97. Acts and contracts under the regime of old laws, if they are valid in accordance therewith, shall be",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        402.53969539141417,
        941.418282638889,
        17.434900568181888
      ],
      "text": "respected, subject to the limitations established in this Code. Any modiacation or extension of these acts and",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        429.3168885732323,
        738.1553394199346,
        17.434900568181888
      ],
      "text": "contracts after the promulgation of this Code, shall be subject to the provisions hereof.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        474.68919949494955,
        941.4206441584969,
        17.434900568181774
      ],
      "text": "ARTICLE 98. Interim rules and regulations promulgated by the Council shall continue to have binding force and",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        501.4662761994949,
        504.2898655637255,
        17.434900568181888
      ],
      "text": "effect, when not in conXict with the provisions of this Code.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        546.8385871212122,
        941.4180816584969,
        17.434900568181774
      ],
      "text": "ARTICLE 99. If any provision or part of this Code, or the application thereof to any person or circumstance, is",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
